.Dd November 12, 2026
.Dt DMESG 1
.Os RavenBSD
.Sh NAME
.Nm dmesg
.Nd print the system log ring
.Sh SYNOPSIS
.Nm
.Nm
.Fl -selftest
.Sh DESCRIPTION
The administrative interface and the full description are in
.Xr dmesg 8 .
The program is installed as
.Pa /sbin/dmesg ;
this section-1 entry exists because the tool's source package lives under
.Pa userland/bin
and the documentation gate requires a section-1 page for that package
directory as well as the section-8 page for the installed path.
.Pp
.Nm
reads
.Pa log:
from its oldest retained record and writes the records to the debug console.
.Sh EXIT STATUS
.Ex -std
A usage error exits with status 2.
.Sh SEE ALSO
.Xr dmesg 8 ,
.Xr logd 8
